      {
        "text": "A Gu Immortal approaches the current generation Ni Xiang and asks about Fixed Immortal Travel and other Immortal Gu. The answer is No. The current generation Ni Xiang is already over fifty years old; using yes or no Immortal Gu once expends fifty years of lifespan, and after that one answer Ni clan’s old clan leader dies on the spot.",
