    "canonical_prices": [],
    "price_claims": [
      {
        "text": "Qi Zai explains that Ni Ren refined Immortal Gu into his descendants’ bloodline so others could not take them away, and that mortals could use those specially chosen Immortal Gu at a high price. Once someone in Ni clan creates such an Immortal Gu in the body, that person is called the current generation Ni Xiang. The first Immortal Gu created is the information path Immortal Gu Yes or No. It gets information from heaven and earth and expresses it through the Gu Master, but only as yes or no. Every answer costs the Gu Master fifty years of lifespan.",
        "chapters": [
          1036
